  (12, 'numbersLecture2', 11, '1. The 2-Successor Scaffold: Root and Sign Branches', 'numbers-lecture2', '
<div align="center">
      <font size="+2"
        ><i><b>Numbers Lecture 2: Binary Trees &amp; Labeled Paths</b></i></font
