            f''(x) = st( Δy / dx )
          </text>
          <text
            x="475"
            y="110"
            text-anchor="middle"
            font-family="sans-serif"
            font-size="9.5"
            fill="#2563eb"
          >
            Actual step dx = 1/ω &gt; 0
          </text>
          <text
            x="475"
            y="130"
