  (8, 'conway_neg', 'ConwayNeg', 'Conway Tree Negation (-X)', 'Tree Reflection Primitive', 'tree_topology', 'primitive', 'Node → Node', 'Inverts every sign step (+ <-> -) along the path, reflecting the node across the tree root 0.', 'X ∈ {+, -}* ⟹ -X ∈ {+, -}*', NULL, ARRAY['X[i] (sign step)', 'TreeConcat(res, invSign)']::text[], 'O(d) sign string inversion where d is birthday depth', 'O(1) numerator integer negation in (𝔻, +, ·)', 'rule ConwayNeg(X: Node) : Node ≔
